cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use sci-figure-maker in your research, please cite this software."
title: "sci-figure-maker"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Filledown"

version: "0.7.0-alpha.1"
date-released: "2026-08-31"

repository-code: "https://github.com/Filledown/sci-figure-maker"

license: MIT

abstract: >
  sci-figure-maker is an automatic scientific figure generation toolkit
  for deep-learning and recognition research. It supports experimental
  data inspection, experiment-type recognition, scientific figure
  recommendation, automatic rendering, and PNG, SVG, and PDF export.

keywords:
  - scientific visualization
  - deep learning
  - machine learning
  - data visualization
  - scientific computing
  - matplotlib
  - research software